---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Contractor License Lookup"
  description="How contractorlicenselookup.org handles visitor data."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 3, 2026.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      Contractor License Lookup does not ask you to sign up, does not set cookies and does not run analytics or
      advertising scripts at the moment. You can use every page without giving us any personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical data such as IP addresses to
      deliver pages and protect the site from abuse. See
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to official boards</h2>
    <p>
      License searches take place on the official state board websites we link to. Those sites have their own privacy
      policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If we add analytics or advertising, we will update this page first and explain what is collected and how to opt
      out.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:contact@contractorlicenselookup.org">contact@contractorlicenselookup.org</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
